\f1\fs22 \'93Is it real?\'94 one of the riot cops mumbled.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Another cop gave the first a slap with a riot shield.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93What?\'94 Alexander asked.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Is it real?\'94 a different cop asked. \'93Do you really execute those lowlifes?\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Alexander snorted and smiled for his own satisfaction.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93\'92Cos, if it is, how do we get in on it?\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Yeah, is there, like, a way you can apply to work on the show?\'94 asked another.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Alexander, faux-heartfelt: \'93The waiting list is nine years.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The cops moaned. \'93Just tell us, then. Are the executions real?\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Of course they are,\'94 Alexander protested. \'93We don\'92t have the budget to fake them.\'94 At least one of those claims, as a matter of record, was patently false.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>A cop sitting at the far end of the cabin, clutching a sniper rifle, grimaced and shook his head.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Tell me where we're going,\'94 Alexander said.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Bomb attack. In the Pale.\'94\
